    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A sickness spreads through the roots of the Nine Worlds, withering the ancient blue roses. As Yggdrasil's branches decay, shadows of old gods stir once more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a lone wanderer in the lands of your ancestors. Haunted by dark forces at every step, you must rediscover ancient runic powers and cleanse these cursed realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this grim Norse world and uncover the secrets that lie beneath. Use precise combat and tactical prowess to overcome dangerous creatures and towering bosses. Gather <i>runic powers</i> and <i>ancient magics</i> to aid you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/e8db5dcc8fcd21744103d9f36d34f762.poster.avif?t=1732272884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/e8db5dcc8fcd21744103d9f36d34f762.webm?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/e8db5dcc8fcd21744103d9f36d34f762.mp4?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an Interconnected World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey from the misty paths of the Whispering Woods to the depths of ancient temples. Each corner holds new dangers and secrets waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/fa8c42a96297882b34fedd8c3b1f435a.poster.avif?t=1732272884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/fa8c42a96297882b34fedd8c3b1f435a.webm?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/fa8c42a96297882b34fedd8c3b1f435a.mp4?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Master Tactical Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every enemy has unique attack patterns and weaknesses. Master timing and positioning to overcome your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/81cd84fc4bdf85090aa0ebf5c2a17d61.poster.avif?t=1732272884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/81cd84fc4bdf85090aa0ebf5c2a17d61.webm?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/81cd84fc4bdf85090aa0ebf5c2a17d61.mp4?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Discover Ancient Powers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new abilities throughout your journey. Use these powers to reach new areas, defeat powerful enemies, and uncover hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/8ec50bde65205df9f83015434acf1e23.poster.avif?t=1732272884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/8ec50bde65205df9f83015434acf1e23.webm?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/8ec50bde65205df9f83015434acf1e23.mp4?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/c86724cbfd5ede2d9d6dc3a54cf44734.avif?t=1732272884\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging, tactical combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interconnected world with meaningful exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple abilities and power-ups to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-crafted pixel art environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Norse mythology-inspired setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden secrets and optional challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique bosses to overcome</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A sickness spreads through the roots of the Nine Worlds, withering the ancient blue roses. As Yggdrasil's branches decay, shadows of old gods stir once more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a lone wanderer in the lands of your ancestors. Haunted by dark forces at every step, you must rediscover ancient runic powers and cleanse these cursed realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this grim Norse world and uncover the secrets that lie beneath. Use precise combat and tactical prowess to overcome dangerous creatures and towering bosses. Gather <i>runic powers</i> and <i>ancient magics</i> to aid you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/e8db5dcc8fcd21744103d9f36d34f762.poster.avif?t=1732272884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/e8db5dcc8fcd21744103d9f36d34f762.webm?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/e8db5dcc8fcd21744103d9f36d34f762.mp4?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an Interconnected World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey from the misty paths of the Whispering Woods to the depths of ancient temples. Each corner holds new dangers and secrets waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/fa8c42a96297882b34fedd8c3b1f435a.poster.avif?t=1732272884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/fa8c42a96297882b34fedd8c3b1f435a.webm?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/fa8c42a96297882b34fedd8c3b1f435a.mp4?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Master Tactical Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every enemy has unique attack patterns and weaknesses. Master timing and positioning to overcome your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/81cd84fc4bdf85090aa0ebf5c2a17d61.poster.avif?t=1732272884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/81cd84fc4bdf85090aa0ebf5c2a17d61.webm?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/81cd84fc4bdf85090aa0ebf5c2a17d61.mp4?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Discover Ancient Powers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new abilities throughout your journey. Use these powers to reach new areas, defeat powerful enemies, and uncover hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/8ec50bde65205df9f83015434acf1e23.poster.avif?t=1732272884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/8ec50bde65205df9f83015434acf1e23.webm?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/8ec50bde65205df9f83015434acf1e23.mp4?t=1732272884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088300/extras/c86724cbfd5ede2d9d6dc3a54cf44734.avif?t=1732272884\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging, tactical combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interconnected world with meaningful exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple abilities and power-ups to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-crafted pixel art environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Norse mythology-inspired setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden secrets and optional challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique bosses to overcome</p></li></ul>",
